# title: All drug-condition associations (registry + literature)
# question: How many distinct drug-condition associations exist when registry-based (investigatedFor) and literature-based (extractedTreats) links are treated uniformly?
# inference: compare
# Uses the super-property bp:associatedWithCondition, which is never asserted: it only exists after
# OWL-RL materialisation (rdfs:subPropertyOf). Without inference this query returns no rows.
SELECT (COUNT(*) AS ?associations)
WHERE { ?drug bp:associatedWithCondition ?cond }
